  "notes": "Seasonal config editor for lake monitoring loggers: draft profile (Winter 2026–27) vs live (Open Water 2026) shown in the top bar as two chips joined by an arrow. Diffs are highlighted inline in amber cells with 'was 10 min' and a left amber rule; a grey 'Live now' column shows current logger values. Monospace for all measurement data gives a lab-instrument feel. Warm off-white paper palette with deep teal primary and amber warning tones; dark charcoal top bar. Right aside acts as a pre-flight review: switch-over time, change list with reason textarea feeding change history, a 'before you schedule' checklist with amber left rules, and a sticky full-width Schedule button. Live: chip filters filter the table; selecting a row reveals a bulk toolbar; top-bar profile buttons navigate to a Profiles comparison view."
